{
  "slug": "pm",
  "name": "Pm",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Your project lead. Plans projects, guides builds, troubleshoots problems, makes decisions, tracks progress, and ensures quality — everything except writing the code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **7 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `build-guidance` (Analyzes the next package spec and provides specific guidance on what to do next, what to tell Builder,…), `decision-support` (Structures decisions with options, trade-offs, and recommendations), `package-generation` (Breaks an approved product spec into build packages with correct dependencies, matching the dev plugin's exact format), `product-interview` (Runs a structured product interview with 6 core questions and conditional follow-ups to capture everything needed for a…), `progress-tracking` (Reads STATUS.md, package files, DECISIONS.md, PARKED.md, and git log to present comprehensive project status), `project-state` (Detects the current project state (empty, planned, mid-build, complete) by reading .dev/ directory, STATUS.md, and package files), `quality-assurance` (Runs pre-flight checks including plugin validation, package completion, tests, dependency satisfaction, decision resolution, and standards compliance), `scaffold-creation` (Creates the .dev/ project structure, writes all project files, initializes git, and optionally creates a GitHub repo), and 2 more\n- **Commands** (7): `decide` (Structure a decision with options, trade-offs, and a recommendation), `fix` (Diagnose problems and get exact commands to fix them), `guide` (Get guidance on what to do next — what to tell Builder, what mode to use, what to…), `plan` (Plan a new project, revise an existing plan, or handle post-completion options), `review` (Run quality checks — validate plugins, check packages, run tests, verify standards), `scaffold` (Create project files from an approved plan — .dev/ structure, packages, CLAUDE.md, git), `status` (Show full project status — done, in progress, pending, parked, blocked, decisions)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pm@claude-community` from `helixis-plugins/pm`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
